B.abo=new A.j1('This Privacy Policy describes Our policies and procedures on the collection, use, and disclosure of Your information when You use the QR Code Studio mobile and web application (the "Application" or "Service") and tells You about Your privacy rights and how the law protects You.\n\nQR Code Studio is a QR code generator, customizer, and scanner utility application developed and published by Sivaprasad NK. By using the Application, You agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.',null)
B.abq=new A.jI(u.v,null)
